Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,We are Team Messiah Project Digital, from Pagadian City in the Philippines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:04.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ube production has fallen 43%.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.31,0:00:08.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,Seven NASA datasets, live in the browser.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.46,0:00:11.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,The farmer pins their field.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.06,0:00:12.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,Set what matters most.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:16.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,A Farm Card scores your field, and every number names its dataset.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.55,0:00:20.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,This button calls NASA POWER right now, for this exact field.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.26,0:00:23.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,Four rotations, including the one you farm now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.19,0:00:27.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tested against real Philippine Statistics Authority data.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:30.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,A twelve month planting calendar built from your own rainfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:34.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Farm Card itself, ready to print and take away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,Satellite against ground. Where they agree the field is behaving like its neighbourhood, and where they do not, the difference is local.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.67,0:00:41.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,The rainfall cross check, two independent NASA products side by side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:44.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every dataset listed, with its resolution and a link back to the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.45,0:00:47.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every number in the app is traceable to the dataset it came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:47.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,One node per barangay, to support the farmer.\NThis tool supports the farmer, it does not replace them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.89,0:00:52.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,One node per barangay, to support the farmer.\NThis tool supports the farmer, it does not replace them.
